{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キツネのMVが公開されました！\n見てくれましたか？？\n私はキツネが大好きです！\nなぜなら、いつもより早く振りが覚えられたからです！！\nなんでだろう？なんでかな？\n自分でもわからないけど、なぜかいつもよりすらっと踊れるようになりました！\n京子も今日付いていけてるじゃん！すごい！って言ってくれるくらい、え？なんで？ってくらいさらっと踊れるようになりました！\nキツネ好きです！\nMVの撮影場所もとっても可愛くて終始楽しかったです！！\nみんなでワーワーキャーキャーして最高に幸せでした！🌙🌙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ82Q7GNRDHTGNXDTPE3DT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ83PTJBDVDB7EA67CPZJ4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ84Q7BE0KMBC2M2EBHKJJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ85NEHRG8MVRCM8CW622D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ86MYJAMFF5D1F53VHQKP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ87KT6T84NKWGA6VC3MTY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ88JGRCQ7FR10RRHAVX7X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ケータリングにクレープとかラーメンとか美味しいものがいっぱいあって最高に幸せだった💓💓\nクレープ食べる丹生ちゃんが可愛すぎてんーーーーって一緒に言ってました🦊🦊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ89HHE2X1VYHE96056P3Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ8AKHE7XFWB9RBTBNFT73","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ8BKD9TGEGCE8JXX2W9EC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ8CHCMRAB4E28VBHYH9M4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々のラーメンとクレープでした🍜💕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、握手会の受付が明日の14時までなので是非会いに来てくれるとすごく嬉しいです！https://fortunemusic.jp/hinatazaka46_201907/\n↑お待ちしています💕💕"}],"source":"archive"}